19. [x] Standard Music Engraving Labeling System Maturation (Gould/MOLA/Bärenreiter Standards):
    [x] Conducted comprehensive engraving research and gap analysis ([.agents/research/labeling_system_maturation_plan.md](.agents/research/labeling_system_maturation_plan.md)) across 5 master engraving laws and created 5-phase maturation plan.
    [x] Phase 1: Critical Bug Fixes (Headroom + Header Suppression):
        [x] Centralized engraving metrics constants (`GroupPlacementMetrics.aboveStaffHeaderClearanceMm = 5.5`, `GroupPlacementMetrics.aboveStaffHeaderOffsetMm = 2.5`) and recursive `allGroups` hierarchy traversal getter on `StaffNodeGroup`.
        [x] Fixed multi-system above-staff vertical headroom in `computeLayout` (`layout.dart`), distributing reserved headroom into inter-system gap so systems never collide or overflow bottom page margins.
        [x] Fixed subsequent-system header re-rendering: strictly suppressed above-staff headers (Model C) on systems 2+ across `layout.dart` and all 4 rendering backends (`svg_emitter.dart`, `pdf_emitter.dart`, `emitter.dart`, and `preview_canvas.dart`) per Gould and MOLA guidelines.
        [x] Added unit tests in `hierarchical_labeling_test.dart` and verified with all 90 core tests and 247 UI tests passing.
    [x] Phase 2: StaffLabelStyle Value Object Extraction:
        [x] Extracted `StaffLabelStyle` value object (`fontFamily`, `fontSizePt`, `isItalic`, `isBold`, `horizontalOffsetMm`, `verticalOffsetMm`) with presets `defaultStaff` and `boldUpright`.
        [x] Refactored `StaffDefinition` to use `labelStyle` with seamless backward-and-forward JSON serialization (reads new `labelStyle` map, losslessly parses legacy 5-field files, and outputs both).
        [x] Added `resolvedLabelStyle` to `StaffPosition` in `layout.dart` and propagated style from definitions.
        [x] Upgraded SVG, PDF, LaTeX, and Interactive Canvas emitters to consume `StaffLabelStyle` (enabling bold/italic font styling and micrometer offsets).
        [x] Added unit tests for serialization, legacy backward compatibility, and emitter font style propagation (91 core tests and 247 UI tests passing).
    [x] Phase 3: DescriptorPlacement Enum (Continental Flush vs Anglo-American Enclosed):
        [x] Added `DescriptorPlacement` enum (`enclosedByConnector`, `outsideConnector`) with localized descriptions.
        [x] Added `descriptorPlacement` field to `StaffNodeGroup` and updated `UpdateGroupDetailsCommand` with full backward compatibility.
        [x] Implemented Universal Brace Rule in `layout.dart` (`brace` is always `outsideConnector`) and Continental layout calculations (`connectorOffsetMm = 0.0` or only displaced by child connectors).
        [x] Promoted `innerStaffIndices` to `StaffSystem` property, resolving architectural gaps L3 and E2 across layout and all 4 emitters.
        [x] Added responsive UI controls in `AdvancedBuilderPanel` (`_QuickLabelingCard`) with visual helper cards.
        [x] Added unit tests, serialization tests, and 35th QA gallery scenario (`hierarchical_continental_outside`). All 95 core tests and 247 UI tests passing.
    [x] Phase 4: GroupHeaderVisibility Enum (Model C Lifecycle Control):
        [x] Added `GroupHeaderVisibility` enum (`firstSystemOnly`, `firstSystemOfPage`, `always`) to `StaffNodeGroup` and `GroupPlacement`.
        [x] Updated `computeLayout` with optional `pageIndex` parameter, cleanly decoupling score-start from page-start to support classical publishing traditions (Bärenreiter/Breitkopf section headings re-printed at the top of each page) while defaulting to Gould/MOLA first-system suppression.
        [x] Added precomputed `isAboveStaffVisible` on `GroupPlacement` and unified all 4 emitters (`preview_canvas.dart`, `svg_emitter.dart`, `pdf_emitter.dart`, and `emitter.dart`).
